  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d95f71226bf26bc4caed6a0458a3b538, type: 3}
  m_Name: Lesson 25 Question 4
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  question: Why can believers pray to God as their Father?
  answers:
  - Because God listens to all prayers
  - Because God adopts believers into His family
  - Because Christians never sin
  - All of the above
  correctAnswerIndex: 1
  discussionAnswer: When someone trust in Jesus for salvation, God rescues them from
    the spiritual family of Satan and adopts them into His family. All believers
    are God's children.
